\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 93.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -93.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"></span><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"># 신입생 제출서류</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"> :</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"> 2010. 8. 23(월) ~ 9. 30(목)</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">까지 <u>각 종합학사행정실(각 학부건물 1층)</u></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">로 제출</span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 122.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -122.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 학적부 구비서류 : 학적부기재사항신고서(</span><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">별도첨부</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">), 사진(3×4) 1매, 주민등록등본 1부. </span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 95.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -95.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 학생증 발급방법 : 학적부기재사항신고서 제출→ 학적부 사진 등재 확인 → 원스톱서비스 ‘학생’→ ‘학생증 발급 조회 및 신청’→ 학생증 발급신청 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 수령장소(학생증발급 요청시 수령장소 지정)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 학사서비스센터(학생회관 1층)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 각 종합학사행정실(각 학부건물 1층)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"><br><font face=\"굴림\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">학생증 발급 신청일로부터 약 2주후 수령가능함</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">.</span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"><br><br><br><font face=\"굴림\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"><br><font face=\"굴림\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">20</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">10. 8.</span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"><br><font face=\"굴림\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">금오공과대학교 대학원(일반, 산업 및 교육대학원)장</span><br></font></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
